WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.107 --> 00:00:02.773
- Well my name's Mike, short for Michael.

00:00:04.514 --> 00:00:06.464
Maybe we can call you El, short for 11.

00:00:07.983 --> 00:00:10.400
(slow music)

00:00:11.351 --> 00:00:12.551
Well, um okay, night El.

00:00:17.456 --> 00:00:18.539
- Night Mike.

00:00:23.401 --> 00:00:26.438
♪ Just a little uncertainty ♪

00:00:26.438 --> 00:00:31.438
♪ Can bring you down ♪

00:00:32.096 --> 00:00:36.778
♪ And nobody wants to know you now ♪

00:00:36.778 --> 00:00:39.324
♪ And nobody wants to show you how ♪

00:00:39.324 --> 00:00:40.157
- [El] Mike, Mike, stop.

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:44.375
- Hey!

00:00:45.814 --> 00:00:47.893
Hey, three inch minimum.

00:00:48.912 --> 00:00:51.495
(upbeat music)

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:56.320
- Ready, are you?

00:00:57.377 --> 00:00:58.679
What knows you are ready?

00:00:58.679 --> 00:00:59.755
His name's Yoda.

00:00:59.755 --> 00:01:01.790
He can use the force to
move things with his mind.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:02.623
Like this.

00:01:04.707 --> 00:01:06.540
Brought you breakfast.

00:01:09.264 --> 00:01:10.264
Just trust me, okay.

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:14.947
(laughing)

00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:20.363
- What is friend?

00:01:21.895 --> 00:01:23.090
- Um a friend is...

00:01:23.936 --> 00:01:25.456
- Is someone that you do anything for.

00:01:25.456 --> 00:01:26.627
- You lend them your cool stuff

00:01:26.627 --> 00:01:28.458
like comic books and trading cards.

00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:29.323
- And they never break a promise.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:35.595
Please, you have to get in
or my mom, she'll find you.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.219
Do you understand?

00:01:37.219 --> 00:01:38.850
I won't tell her about you, I promise.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:39.683
- Promise?

00:01:40.671 --> 00:01:42.663
- It means something that
you can't break, ever.

00:01:45.823 --> 00:01:47.173
Eleven, is everything okay?

00:01:48.697 --> 00:01:49.530
El?

00:01:53.931 --> 00:01:55.060
- Mike.

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.810
- Is everything okay?

00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:00.166
Are you sure?

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:02.540
- I promise.

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:06.420
(soft techno music)

00:02:23.673 --> 00:02:25.774
- Wow, she looks...

00:02:25.774 --> 00:02:27.252
- Pretty.

00:02:27.252 --> 00:02:29.662
- Will's in fairy land now right?

00:02:29.662 --> 00:02:31.413
Flying around with all
the other little fairies.

00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:36.054
(gasping)

00:02:37.913 --> 00:02:40.330
- You're dead, Wheeler, dead!

00:02:48.975 --> 00:02:50.275
- Dude, Troy peed himself.

00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:54.004
(crowd laughing)

00:02:58.859 --> 00:02:59.692
- El?

00:03:00.912 --> 00:03:01.745
- Yes.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:04.870
- I'm happy you're home.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:07.053
- Me too.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.190
- Guys, it's Lucas.

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:18.695
I think he's in trouble.

00:03:18.695 --> 00:03:20.583
- Maybe we can go to
the Snow Ball together?

00:03:21.776 --> 00:03:22.741
- Snow Ball?

00:03:22.741 --> 00:03:23.839
- It's this cheesy school dance

00:03:23.839 --> 00:03:25.563
where you go in the gym and
dance to music and stuff.

00:03:26.514 --> 00:03:29.260
You go to school dances with someone that,

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.093
you know, someone that you like?

00:03:32.615 --> 00:03:33.658
- Friend?

00:03:33.658 --> 00:03:34.908
- Not a friend,

00:03:38.516 --> 00:03:39.349
someone like a...

00:03:42.601 --> 00:03:45.018
(slow music)

00:03:49.532 --> 00:03:50.453
Just hold on a little longer, okay?

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:53.070
He's gone, the bad man's gone.

00:03:54.443 --> 00:03:56.026
We'll be home soon.

00:03:56.942 --> 00:03:58.742
My mom, she'll get you your own bed.

00:04:00.253 --> 00:04:02.133
You can eat as many Eggos as you want.

00:04:04.762 --> 00:04:06.173
And we can go to the Snow Ball.

00:04:10.915 --> 00:04:13.524
- Promise?

00:04:13.524 --> 00:04:14.357
- Promise.

00:04:15.808 --> 00:04:17.975
(roaring)

00:04:36.945 --> 00:04:39.302
Hello, are you there?

00:04:39.302 --> 00:04:40.135
El?

00:04:42.686 --> 00:04:43.953
It's me, it's Mike.

00:04:45.849 --> 00:04:48.523
Day 352, 7:40 pm.

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:51.793
I'm still here.

00:04:53.093 --> 00:04:53.926
- I know it's difficult to accept,

00:04:54.877 --> 00:04:56.403
the stories she told you were not true.

00:04:57.803 --> 00:04:59.033
She's a very dangerous individual.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:01.643
- [Man] If she contacts
you, you must tell us.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:03.950
- [Woman] Otherwise
you're putting yourself

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.883
and your entire family at risk.

00:05:07.884 --> 00:05:09.234
Do you understand, Michael?

00:05:10.355 --> 00:05:11.855
Do you understand?

00:05:13.128 --> 00:05:14.461
- [Man] Michael?

00:05:15.512 --> 00:05:16.345
Michael?

00:05:20.121 --> 00:05:20.954
- Mike.

00:05:26.412 --> 00:05:27.245
- I never gave up on you.

00:05:28.979 --> 00:05:29.812
I called you every night.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:31.803
Every night for...

00:05:31.803 --> 00:05:32.636
- 353 days.

00:05:35.167 --> 00:05:37.327
I heard.
- I can't lose you again.

00:05:39.128 --> 00:05:40.700
- You won't lose me.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:41.550
- Do you promise?

00:05:43.631 --> 00:05:44.464
- Promise.

00:05:47.563 --> 00:05:49.314
♪ Every game you play ♪

00:05:49.314 --> 00:05:51.159
♪ Every night you stay ♪

00:05:51.159 --> 00:05:52.911
♪ I'll be watching you ♪

00:05:52.911 --> 00:05:54.661
- Do you wanna dance?

00:05:56.036 --> 00:05:56.986
- I don't know how.

00:05:58.744 --> 00:05:59.577
- I don't either.

00:06:00.429 --> 00:06:02.679
Do you wanna figure it out?

00:06:03.761 --> 00:06:06.735
♪ Now my fool heart aches ♪

00:06:06.735 --> 00:06:11.040
♪ With every step you take ♪

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:14.999
♪ Every move you make ♪

00:06:14.999 --> 00:06:16.380
♪ Every vow you break ♪

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:17.880
- I wish I was still with you.

00:06:18.939 --> 00:06:20.585
- I know, me too.

00:06:20.585 --> 00:06:21.938
But I'll see you tomorrow, all right?

00:06:21.938 --> 00:06:22.771
First thing.

00:06:22.771 --> 00:06:23.604
- Tomorrow.

00:06:24.643 --> 00:06:25.701
I have to go home.

00:06:25.701 --> 00:06:26.729
- We're almost there.

00:06:26.729 --> 00:06:27.980
- Sorry man, curfew.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:29.626
Come on, let's go.

00:06:29.626 --> 00:06:30.626
- Good luck.

00:06:33.384 --> 00:06:34.811
- Curfew at four?

00:06:34.811 --> 00:06:35.706
- They're lying.

00:06:35.706 --> 00:06:36.717
- It's been like this all summer.

00:06:36.717 --> 00:06:37.625
- It's romantic.

00:06:37.625 --> 00:06:38.523
- It's gross.

00:06:38.523 --> 00:06:40.189
- It's bullshit.

00:06:40.189 --> 00:06:41.022
I just got home.

00:06:43.949 --> 00:06:44.782
Well their loss, right?

00:06:46.428 --> 00:06:47.829
- Is there um...

00:06:47.829 --> 00:06:49.673
- Uh oh, I think we're in trouble.

00:06:52.729 --> 00:06:53.562
Hello?

00:06:55.101 --> 00:06:56.451
- It's 9:32, where are you?

00:06:57.387 --> 00:06:59.545
- Sorry I was just about to call.

00:06:59.545 --> 00:07:02.163
I um can't see you today.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:03.833
- Why not?

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.923
- It's my nana, she's very sick.

00:07:07.887 --> 00:07:08.940
- What?

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:10.743
- Mom, get off the phone!

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:12.929
How many times?

00:07:12.929 --> 00:07:14.187
- Did nana call?

00:07:14.187 --> 00:07:17.023
- No mom, just get off the phone!

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:23.952
Sorry about that.

00:07:23.952 --> 00:07:25.154
- Is that your mom?

00:07:25.154 --> 00:07:27.404
- Yeah, she's so upset
she's making no sense.

00:07:28.282 --> 00:07:31.624
'Cause we have to go to the
nursing home to see nana.

00:07:31.624 --> 00:07:33.023
- You can come over after.

00:07:33.023 --> 00:07:34.740
- No, I mean I just think

00:07:36.126 --> 00:07:37.376
I need to be alone today.

00:07:39.183 --> 00:07:40.383
What are you doing here?

00:07:41.554 --> 00:07:43.208
- Shopping.

00:07:43.208 --> 00:07:44.041
- This is her new style.

00:07:44.932 --> 00:07:45.986
What do you think?

00:07:45.986 --> 00:07:47.109
- What's wrong with you?

00:07:47.109 --> 00:07:48.550
You know she's not allowed to be here.

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:49.817
- What is she, your little pet?

00:07:49.817 --> 00:07:51.233
- Yeah, am I your pet?

00:07:52.169 --> 00:07:53.268
- What, no!

00:07:53.268 --> 00:07:54.769
- Then why do you treat me like garbage?

00:07:54.769 --> 00:07:55.679
- What?

00:07:55.679 --> 00:07:56.894
- You said nana was sick.

00:07:56.894 --> 00:07:59.640
- She is, she is, she is sick.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.343
- She's sick, she's super sick.

00:08:02.198 --> 00:08:04.097
That's why we're here actually.

00:08:04.097 --> 00:08:05.166
- Yeah, we're shopping,

00:08:05.166 --> 00:08:07.120
not for us but her her, nana.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.017
- For nana.

00:08:08.017 --> 00:08:10.060
- Also we're here to get a gift for you.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:12.549
Because we couldn't find
anything that suited you

00:08:12.549 --> 00:08:15.152
and I only have like
three dollars and 50 cents

00:08:15.152 --> 00:08:16.091
so it's hard.

00:08:16.091 --> 00:08:17.580
- Super hard.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.433
It's expensive.

00:08:20.481 --> 00:08:21.314
- You lie.

00:08:23.728 --> 00:08:24.561
Why do you lie?

00:08:32.556 --> 00:08:34.149
I dump your ass.

00:08:34.149 --> 00:08:36.732
(upbeat music)

00:08:42.243 --> 00:08:45.554
♪ You're as cold as ice ♪

00:08:45.554 --> 00:08:49.558
♪ You're willing to sacrifice our love ♪

00:08:49.558 --> 00:08:50.391
- Hey.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:54.873
- Hi.

00:08:55.832 --> 00:08:58.003
- Does your species like M&amp;M's?

00:08:59.663 --> 00:09:02.080
(slow music)

00:09:10.608 --> 00:09:12.750
I like the new look by the way, it's cool.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:13.583
- Thanks.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.952
- Seriously Mike?

00:09:19.952 --> 00:09:21.281
- I'm just trying to
demonstrate how careless

00:09:21.281 --> 00:09:23.059
Max is with Eleven's powers.

00:09:23.059 --> 00:09:24.485
In fact how careless all of you are.

00:09:24.485 --> 00:09:26.204
You're treating her like
some kind of machine

00:09:26.204 --> 00:09:27.247
when she's not a machine.

00:09:27.247 --> 00:09:28.728
And I don't want her to
die looking for the flate

00:09:28.728 --> 00:09:29.740
when they've obviously vanished
off the face of the Earth.

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.540
So can we please just
come up with a new plan

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:33.173
because I love her,

00:09:33.173 --> 00:09:34.123
and I can't lose her again.

00:09:42.784 --> 00:09:44.242
- What's going on?

00:09:44.242 --> 00:09:45.925
- Nothing, nothing.

00:09:45.925 --> 00:09:47.646
- Just family discussion.

00:09:47.646 --> 00:09:48.479
- Oh.

00:09:49.419 --> 00:09:50.252
Mike?

00:09:51.145 --> 00:09:51.978
- Yeah.

00:09:54.605 --> 00:09:57.573
- Remember that day at the cabin?

00:09:58.522 --> 00:10:00.464
You were talking to Max?

00:10:00.464 --> 00:10:02.023
- Um, I don't think I follow.

00:10:03.129 --> 00:10:05.513
- You talked about your
feelings, your heart.

00:10:06.575 --> 00:10:08.033
- Oh, oh yeah that.

00:10:08.878 --> 00:10:10.731
Man that was so long ago.

00:10:10.731 --> 00:10:13.433
I know, it's just heat of the moment stuff

00:10:13.433 --> 00:10:16.350
and we were arguing and
I don't really remember

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.460
what did I say exactly?

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:21.293
- Mike,

00:10:28.186 --> 00:10:29.436
I love you too.

00:10:30.288 --> 00:10:32.705
(slow music)

